# Chalk captures on Defiant. Times are America/Chicago, set by the entrypoint
# via /etc/localtime, so these track US daylight saving on their own -- unlike
# the GitHub Actions crons, which are pinned to UTC and drift an hour when the
# clocks change. There is nothing to adjust on Nov 1.
#
# Each line names a job and nothing else. Which npm scripts a job runs is
# decided by the job table at the top of run-job.sh, so the schedule and the
# runner cannot fall out of step, and the command below is exactly what you
# type by hand to test one. run-job.sh logs the run to /app/logs, records the
# Odds API budget left, and stamps a heartbeat. Edit here, then rebuild.
#
# Cron gives a job almost no environment of its own, so both of these matter:
# without PATH there is no node or npm on it at all.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

# m  h  dom mon dow  command
#
# --- lines: the daily baseline, then one capture just before each kickoff slot
17  9   *   *   *    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot
19  11  *   *   0    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot
49  14  *   *   0    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot
49  18  *   *   0    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot
49  18  *   *   4    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot
49  18  *   *   1    /app/docker/run-job.sh snapshot

# --- anytime-TD prices, the day before the slate. Costs one API credit a game.
37  9   *   *   6    /app/docker/run-job.sh props

# --- ESPN injuries and per-game news. Free, so it runs twice: Saturday with the
#     props, and again Sunday morning for the overnight injury changes.
40  9   *   *   6    /app/docker/run-job.sh context
40  9   *   *   0    /app/docker/run-job.sh context

# --- grading, once the week's games are final
23  7   *   *   2    /app/docker/run-job.sh grade
23  7   *   *   5    /app/docker/run-job.sh grade

# --- Tuesday rebuild. Games first, then the ingest-pbp job, which is the chain
#     ingest:pbp -> ingest:players -> rate and stops at the first failure, so a
#     bad play-by-play pull never goes on to rate teams off stale weeks.
20  8   *   *   2    /app/docker/run-job.sh ingest-games
23  8   *   *   2    /app/docker/run-job.sh ingest-pbp
